From: Kazumasa Shimomura <kazu.devapp@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Apr 2026 11:07:55 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3820/5749] fix(git-master): align validation check with
 language-profile approach

---
 src/features/builtin-skills/git-master/SKILL.md                 | 2 +-
 .../skills/git-master-sections/commit-workflow.ts               | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/features/builtin-skills/git-master/SKILL.md b/src/features/builtin-skills/git-master/SKILL.md
index 0aeb6824..15d032c7 100644
--- a/src/features/builtin-skills/git-master/SKILL.md
+++ b/src/features/builtin-skills/git-master/SKILL.md
@@ -527,7 +527,7 @@ IF style == SHORT:
 
 **VALIDATION before each commit:**
 1. Does message match detected style?
-2. Does language match detected language?
+2. Does message use the repository's dominant language/script profile (from Phase 1.1)?
 3. Is it similar to examples from git log?
 
 If ANY check fails -> REWRITE message.
diff --git a/src/features/builtin-skills/skills/git-master-sections/commit-workflow.ts b/src/features/builtin-skills/skills/git-master-sections/commit-workflow.ts
index 4731620b..055b4270 100644
--- a/src/features/builtin-skills/skills/git-master-sections/commit-workflow.ts
+++ b/src/features/builtin-skills/skills/git-master-sections/commit-workflow.ts
@@ -455,7 +455,7 @@ IF style == SHORT:
 
 **VALIDATION before each commit:**
 1. Does message match detected style?
-2. Does language match detected language?
+2. Does message use the repository's dominant language/script profile (from Phase 1.1)?
 3. Is it similar to examples from git log?
 
 If ANY check fails -> REWRITE message.
